  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre TEMPO 265 V2 is a lightweight women's performance racquet designed for regular, recreational and developing players. It features a 102 sq.in head, 265 g unstrung weight, shortened 67.5 cm frame and a 16x19 string pattern. X-SHORT technology reduces overall bulk and helps improve racquet-head acceleration, while the larger 102 sq.in head provides additional power and forgiveness. Its lightweight construction also makes it suitable for younger players transitioning toward adult racquets.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre TEMPO 265 V2 是一款专为女性球员设计的轻量化高性能球拍，主要面向日常、休闲及成长型球员。球拍采用102平方英寸拍面、265克空拍重量、67.5厘米缩短拍长及16×19线床。X-SHORT 技术通过缩短拍身减少挥拍阻力，使拍头更容易加速；102平方英寸大拍面则提供更大的甜区、更轻松的力量输出及更高容错率。轻量化设计也非常适合正在向成人球拍过渡的年轻球员。"
  },

